Test-Driven Development (TDD) Walkthrough: is_leap_year()
TDD cycle: Red → Green → Refactor.
We implement Gregorian leap-year rules:

Divisible by 400 → leap

Else divisible by 100 → not leap

Else divisible by 4 → leap

Else → not leap


